04:53:47.450 --> 04:53:49.980
I understand you're having problems.

04:53:49.980 --> 04:53:50.930
Huh?

04:53:50.930 --> 04:53:52.810
Well, it's none of your business.

04:53:52.810 --> 04:53:55.630
I realize I may be out of line for saying so,

04:53:55.630 --> 04:54:00.000
but don't you think the fact that this search is taking so long will affect your evaluation?

04:54:00.030 --> 04:54:02.980
